e":3,"candidate":"C3","reason":"Attaches “of the road” to the add clause instead of to the right side.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":366,"group":"4","grade":3,"candidate":"C4","reason":"Reduces “the right side” to an unqualified side, losing the right-side placement.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":366,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Represents the let-us-add request and links the roadrunner to the right side of the road.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":366,"group":"6","grade":8,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Keeps the add object and its placement on the right side of the road.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":366,"group":"7","grade":8,"candidate":"C7","reason":"Attaches the road’s right-side location directly to the roadrunner being added.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":366,"group":"8","grade":3,"candidate":"C8","reason":"Misassigns “’s” as an indirect object of add rather than the subject in “let us add.”","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":367,"group":"0","grade":8,"candidate":"C0","reason":"Coordinates putting it in presentation mode and starting from the first slide.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":367,"group":"1","grade":4,"candidate":"C1","reason":"Captures both imperatives and their links, but classifies “start” as a make action without support.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":367,"group":"2","grade":1,"candidate":"C2","reason":"Treats “start” as an entity within the put instruction instead of a second imperative.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":367,"group":"3","grade":1,"candidate":"C3","reason":"Treats “start” as an entity rather than the predicate of a coordinated imperative.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":367,"group":"4","grade":8,"candidate":"C4","reason":"Keeps the two imperatives, presentation mode as the put destination, and the first slide as the start point.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":367,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Represents both coordinated instructions with their 